[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2873721603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106271#issuecomment-2873721603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106271","id":2873721603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rSYMD","user":{"login":"ze2j","id":46556066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTU2MDY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46556066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j","html_url":"https://github.com/ze2j","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T19:14:10Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T19:14:10Z","body":"I also encountered this issue a few days ago in my project. My use case is slightly different from yours, as I instantiate C++ objects in the main thread and then call some of their methods from different threads.\n\nCurrently `GDExtension` is not thread-safe. There's at least one data race involving the `_gdvirtual_##m_name##_initialized` boolean for each method (it's implemented with a lazy initialization logic).\n\nIn my project, I worked around this by calling the methods once from the main thread to initialize them safely. This approach seems to work, as I haven't experienced any crashes since then. However, I’d appreciate input from the experts regarding whether this is a safe solution.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2873721603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2878268600","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106271#issuecomment-2878268600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106271","id":2878268600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rjuS4","user":{"login":"abcjjy","id":1791493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTE0OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1791493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcjjy","html_url":"https://github.com/abcjjy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcjjy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcjjy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcjjy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcjjy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcjjy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcjjy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcjjy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcjjy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcjjy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T00:33:24Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T00:33:24Z","body":"@ze2j I didn't find anything about GDExtension thread safety in the doc. And the GDExtension object can be instantiated in thread before 4.4 without error. What has changed since v4.4? Maybe I should submit an issue to godot-cpp repo?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2878268600/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2878985562","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106271#issuecomment-2878985562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106271","id":2878985562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rmdVa","user":{"login":"ze2j","id":46556066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTU2MDY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46556066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j","html_url":"https://github.com/ze2j","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T07:14:41Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T07:14:41Z","body":"> I didn't find anything about GDExtension thread safety in the doc. And the GDExtension object can be instantiated in thread before 4.4 without error. What has changed since v4.4? Maybe I should submit an issue to godot-cpp repo?\n\nI think GDExtension has never been thread safe but I  can be wrong obviously. That's why I would like to get feedback from the maintainers to know what the status exactly is, and if the workaround I proposed is safe. If you never experienced crashes before with this code it may be just luck (or bad luck) as data races are very sensitive to any change in the code. I am going to try to reproduce the issue on earlier Godot versions to confirm my claims.\n\nIf I am correct, the documentation should mention the thread safety issues. Fixing the issue does not seem a trivial task and may require a proposal (didn't find one).  \n\nps: You are at the right place to discuss this issue. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2878985562/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]